=== N4 C != 0 steelman: steady inflow
  to hold rho(r)=V^2/(4 pi G r^2) by flow, V 220: Mdot = 6.424e+12 Msun/Gyr, independent of r; mass delivered to the sink in 10 Gyr = 64.2 x M200; drains r<8 kpc in 14 Myr
  conversely Mdot = M200/10 Gyr gives rho(8 kpc) = 2.178e+05 Msun/kpc^3 vs needed 1.399e+07 (1.6e-02 of it)
  what survives: at fixed C and r, baryons deepen the well, v 417 -> 465 km/s at 8 kpc, so n falls by 0.897. A real sign, only for a flow with a sink.

